{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55820","headline":"行至双溪口午炊主人开瓮求诗作 · 詹敦仁","name":"行至双溪口午炊主人开瓮求诗作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"地僻双溪合，村深邸舍稀。\n主人如旧识，稚子觅新诗。\n洗杓开春醖，淘粳作午炊。\n春风吹酒醒，琴剑又追随。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"詹敦仁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}